m\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180215_161454-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4549\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180215_161454-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180215_161454-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180215_161454-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180215_161454.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4549'>\n\t\t\t\tChuck &#038; Della @ Homasassa Springs\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180221_065706.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180221_065706-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180221_065706-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180221_065706-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180221_065706-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180221_065706.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180119_100325.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180119_100325-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4561\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180119_100325-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180119_100325-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180119_100325-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180119_100325.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4561'>\n\t\t\t\tPhil &#038; Cheryl @ Summerdale, AL\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180220_214629.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"875\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180220_214629-802x1024.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-4544\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180220_214629-802x1024.jpg 802w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180220_214629-235x300.jpg 235w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/20180220_214629-768x980.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-4544'>\n\t\t\t\tJohn &#038; Linda @ The Villages\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>While traveling and workamping have their rewards (being able to see the sights and helping to pay the way), by far the best part of this full-time RV lifestyle is the opportunity to hook up with old friends and meet so many new ones along the way.<\/p>\n<p>We are blessed to have this opportunity to travel.<\/p>\n<p>Our plans for the near future include; heading back to Ohio in April to visit family, then up to our <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/08\/13\/workamping-at-pere-marquette-rv-park-baldwin-mich\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Workamping gig in Michigan<\/a> for the summer at <a href=\"https:\/\/www.peremarquettervpark.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pere Marquette Oaks RV Resort<\/a>, while fall of 2018 will take us to Albuquerque, NM where we&#8217;ll be working at the annual <a href=\"http:\/\/balloonfiesta.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">International Balloon Fiesta<\/a>, then on to our leased lot at <a href=\"http:\/\/www.roversroost.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rover&#8217;s Roost RV Park<\/a> in Casa Grande, AZ for the winter with an excursion in mid-January to Quartzite, AZ to work at the <a href=\"http:\/\/www.quartzsitervshow.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">&#8220;Big Tent&#8221; RV Show<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>We haven&#8217;t planned spring and summer of 2019 yet, it&#8217;s a little too early to start nailing anything down, but we hope to be somewhere in the northwest U.S.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/NW-US.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft size-full wp-image-4568\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/NW-US.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"772\" height=\"409\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/NW-US.jpg 772w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/NW-US-300x159.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/03\/NW-US-768x407.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 772px) 100vw, 772px\" \/><\/a>\u00a0We hope you&#8217;ll ride along!\u00a0 Oh, and by the way, feel free to comment down below &#8211; it&#8217;s great to hear from you TOO!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>NOTE: We are currently back at Livingston, TX for a couple weeks while we volunteer at the annual CARE Center Health Fair at the Escapee&#8217;s RV Park.\u00a0 We&#8217;ll be leaving here Mar 31st and heading back to Ohio (for a bit). WOW!\u00a0 It&#8217;s been a long time since I&#8217;ve posted anything.\u00a0 Now that we&#8217;ve got &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2018\/03\/18\/great-february-in-florida\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Great February In Florida<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":4612,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[406,677,19546,554707329],"tags":[554707539,554707536,554707534,554707537,554707535,554707538],"class_list":["post-4533","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-family","category-friends","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","tag-bushnell","tag-ocala","tag-orlando","tag-polk-city","tag-sebring","tag-webster"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4533","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4533"}],"version-history":[{"count":9,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4533\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":4643,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4533\/revisions\/4643"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/4612"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4533"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4533"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4533"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}